g ones are what worry me, so could you pull up the Dennoe trip costs that came to more than one hundred and seventy?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0026\", \"v\": [[\"They finally called back with a slot, so can you pop the dentist check-up in for tuesday at 4:30pm before I forget about it?\"], [\"Would you please add a dentist check-up on tuesday at 4:30pm to my calendar?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0027\", \"v\": [[\"I'm filling in a form and I've totally blanked on it, what's Josefine's last name again?\"], [\"ok so what's… uh, what's Josefine's surname?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0028\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me which events I have on friday, please?\", \"Could you find any blackbird events in my calendar for me?\", \"Would you mind showing me the photos I've marked as favourites?\", \"Please add the third one to the Dennoe 2024 album.\"], [\"friday events?\", \"blackbird events?\", \"my favourite pics\", \"third one to Dennoe 2024 album\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0029\", \"v\": [[\"Nomara — phoned today, log it\", \"ten minute to-dos?\", \"any Portloe pictures?\", \"calendar?\", \"move the squash one to saturday\"], [\"Please log a call for Nomara — I phoned her today.\", \"Could you tell me which of my tasks take about ten minute each?\", \"Do I have any pictures to do with Portloe, please?\", \"What about in my calendar, could you check that too?\", \"Could you move the squash one to saturday, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0030\", \"v\": [[\"Nomara Brandow — phoned today, log it\"], [\"Could you please record that I spoke with Nomara Brandow? I phoned her today.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0031\", \"v\": [[\"delete the service task\", \"wrong one — the empty one\", \"delete every table photo\"], [\"My list is getting cluttered and I've already dealt with it, so could you get rid of the service task for me?\", \"Oh no, sorry, that was the wrong one, I actually meant the empty task, the one with nothing in it.\", \"Totally different thing, I've got way too many shots of the same furniture, so can you bin every table photo I have?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0032\", \"v\": [[\"I'm putting together the trip pictures from this year, so could you add the mantua wood photo to the Seagull 2025 album?\", \"Now I can't remember exactly where I was standing when I took it, where was that one shot?\", \"I remember it being a lovely spot, so can you pull up the other pictures I took there?\", \"I'm trying to place that Mantua one properly, where was it taken exactly?\", \"I might add more of them to the album, so what other shots have I got from that spot?\", \"Switching gears, I caught up with an old friend earlier, so can you note that I had coffee with Grolou Montague today?\"], [\"Would you please put the mantua wood photo in the Seagull 2025 album?\", \"Could you tell me where it was taken?\", \"Would you mind showing me the photos from there?\", \"Could you tell me where the Mantua one was taken, please?\", \"What other photos do I have from there, please?\", \"Could you please log that I had coffee with Grolou Montague today?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0033\", \"v\": [[\"umm which of my pictures have, like, marzipan in them?\", \"oh ok and where was it… where was that taken?\", \"right, different thing, uh what events are at Lymere Cove, the place itself I mean?\", \"ok can you just show me the photos from there?\", \"and umm do I have any photos of salmon?\"], [\"marzipan pictures?\", \"taken where?\", \"Lymere Cove events?\", \"pics from there\", \"any salmon photos?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0034\", \"v\": [[\"hmm do I have any, uh, paperwork about pizaum?\", \"nah, you know what, just leave it\", \"umm what about my notes, anything on it there?\"], [\"pizaum paperwork?\", \"nah, leave it\", \"in my notes?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0035\", \"v\": [[\"We're settling up after the trip and I want to get it right, so how much does Josefine owe me in Dennoe?\", \"And Nomara, what's she owe me?\"], [\"Josefine owes me what, Dennoe?\", \"and Nomara?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0036\", \"v\": [[\"I want to get a card sorted in good time this year, so when is Maud's birthday?\", \"Different thing, I'm curious about spots I've barely photographed, which places do I have just one photo from?\", \"That Flemness one sounds nice, I'd forgotten I'd been, can you show me the photos from there?\", \"Oh and while I'm tidying up my files, could you star the parking document so I can find it later?\", \"Ah sorry, that's the wrong document, I actually meant the wardrobe one, can you star that instead?\"], [\"umm when's Maud's birthday?\", \"ok so… which places have I got exactly one photo from?\", \"uh the Flemness one, can you show me the photos from there?\", \"oh and can you star the, umm, the parking document?\", \"no wait, wrong one, I meant the wardrobe one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0037\", \"v\": [[\"Maud dinner when?\"], [\"umm when's my… my dinner with Maud?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w27-0038\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what's left to do on the mantua wood plan, please?\", \"Would you mind showing me the ten minute jobs on my list?\", \"Could you tell me what the steps are for cancel maud's kiln, please?\"], [\"mantua wood — what's left?\", \"ten minute jobs?\", \"steps for cancel maud's kiln?\"]]}","ttft_ms":11811,"type":"result","duration_ms":30252,"uuid":"1fd5bbb1-2cb3-464e-b247-c872c1c75483","ttft_stream_ms":1755,"time_to_request_ms":159,"first_content_frame_ms":1756,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22343786,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278893961.6716,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
